# Prior-identity "abstract schema / governance framework" artifacts were removed
# from the working tree on 2026-07-26 (ADR-0050 migration) and quarantined at
# /opt/workspace/runtime/.quarantine/context-repository-prior-identity/. They
# were never tracked. The per-file ignore rules that used to live here are gone
# with the files. Do not reintroduce that identity.

# NOTE: `spec/` was gitignored until 2026-07-12. It was ignored to bury the
# prior identity's abstract-schema work — but `spec/discovery-framework/` (the
# L1 canon: obligations model, validator rules, the eight JSON Schemas) was
# later built underneath that path and silently inherited the ignore. The
# highest truth source in the system was therefore untracked for ~3 months:
# undiffable, unreviewable, unrevertable. Do not re-add it. If a path under
# spec/ ever needs ignoring, ignore that path, never the root.

# Python bytecode from the conformance checker.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
